It comes a week after[ rival] Fortnite began inviting players to test its own mobile version. Unlike PUBG, Fortnite will allow players to play across platforms -- meaning iPhone players can kill[ or] be killed by gamers[ on] PC or PlayStation 4.
Fortnite[ recently surpassed pioneer] PUBG[ in] popularity[. Both games feature] 100 players landing on a deserted island filled with weapons, with everyone fighting to be the last person left standing[.] While PUB[G] adopts a realistic setting, Fortnite has a more cartoon-like look -- and an emphasis on building structures sets it apart from its rival.
