Hockney, who will turn 80 next year, will also be the subject of a massive retrospective at Tate Britain, scheduled to run February 9–May 29, 2017.[ B]illed as his most comprehensive exhibition to date, the[ show] will include a number of never-before-seen works.
David Hockney, Beverly Hills Housewife(1966–67). Courtesy of Christie�[�s] New[ York].
