In the coming months, Congress will make decisions that may dramatically shape Crape’s monthly housing payments, and possibly even her status as a[ voucher] holder. With budget cuts looming, public housing authorities across the[ country] are preparing to shrink their Housing[ Choice] Vou[cher] programs. Philosophically, staff in St. Louis and elsewhere will have to decide on the lesser of two evils: cut the number of[ vouchers or] slash the value that[ vouchers] provide.
